  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Data and Evidence to inform Childcare Reform</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This research programme will enhance outcomes for at risk children by improving the quality and availability of data on children in care, scoping and synthesising fragmented evidence, incorporating the voices of those directly affected by care systems, and convening relevant stakeholders. This will inform internal and international policy and practice, and any future research investments, on childcare reform and deinstitutionalisation.</narrative>
  </description>
